 "remarks": "Spacious one bedroom condominium with private balcony located on second top floor level. New water heater installed 2022. New carpet installed in 2025. Bathtub received new coating in 2025, with new vanity and sink. Large living area with sliding glass doors, galley kitchen with stainless steel appliances, dining area, with new washer and dryer installed in 2025. Excellent location, convenient to train, Meritt, I-95 and Route 7. Beautiful in ground pool and plenty of greenery and picnic area. Separate storage area located on property. Walking distance to restaurants, shopping and medical facilities. One reserved parking spot, 1st one next to building. Additional spots available for second car and guests. A must see!",
